  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c3d1f84f8a1eb35",
      "translationZh": "为什么所有 LLM 画出的鹈鹕都长这样？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42de0abc0dacda71",
      "translationZh": "当给它们的提示词是“生成一幅鹈鹕骑自行车的 SVG 图像”时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f3bc719c901230a",
      "translationZh": "来自 Simon Willison 多次运行的原始 SVG · 采用能返回 SVG 的最高推理设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d65b6152f098a2e8",
      "translationZh": "明明它们可以长成这样？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86ef5a0e0f59ecd4",
      "translationZh": "这就是无人谈论的 LLM 多样性坍缩问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2bfac0cdb80c917f",
      "translationZh": "附言：作为 LLM 创造力研究的一部分，我们对 UI 设计中的这种多样性坍缩进行了基准评测。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f853a51219c7ac22",
      "translationZh": "Design Creativity Bench 创造力得分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f644c053731ff9f1",
      "translationZh": "查看完整排行榜 ↗",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4697a826b39eb30b",
      "translationZh": "⚠️ 前沿 AI 模型在设计创造力方面仍显著落后于人类设计师。⚠️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f732ccaa6ba1adee",
      "translationZh": "现推出 Design Creativity Bench，这是一项评估 AI 模型在 UI 设计任务中创造力的新基准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99d01da96b24df4f",
      "translationZh": "尽管在生成功能完备的网站和产品 UI 方面进步迅速，领先的 AI 模型仍难以做出富有创意的设计决策。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8bd1ec3c36128a71",
      "translationZh": "我们在 80 项开放式 UI 任务上评估了 16 个前沿模型，每项任务都分别适配了两个不同的产品领域，并配有人类设计师的设计作为参考。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80de649510f2f295",
      "translationZh": "现有的 UI 基准通常只衡量单一的输出质量指标。而我们衡量的是设计创造力的三个维度：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8fd6a26e92bb7db7",
      "translationZh": "– 原创性：对于同一份设计需求，模型的设计与其他模型输出的差异程度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "75d7eb86e23d43dd",
      "translationZh": "– 创意跨度：当产品领域发生变化时，模型调整其设计决策的幅度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ac6aedb6bad00bf",
      "translationZh": "– 适切性：生成的 UI 在多大程度上满足设计简报中的功能需求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cab884305c25591",
      "translationZh": "结果显示，整体创造力存在显著差距：表现最好的模型 @OpenAI GPT-6 Astra 得分为 65.5，而人类参考得分为 92.3。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2707fa77f43a4bc",
      "translationZh": "我们将发布完整排行榜、评估方法和可复现的评估框架，使设计创造力成为前沿模型能力的一个可衡量维度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87d309100a17e6ce",
      "translationZh": "📊 基准测试排行榜：https://kombai.com/benchmark/",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3826383f614e7440",
      "translationZh": "📄 论文：https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.11539",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdd9ef3d54236567",
      "translationZh": "🤗 HuggingFace 数据集：https://huggingface.co/datasets/Kombai/design-creativity-bench",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
